T*
(   5. Bandwidth \(BW\) and Half-Power Frequencies:) Tj
T*
(   - Half-power frequencies f1 and f2 occur where current drops to I_0 / sqrt\(2\) \(power drops to) Tj
T*
(   P_max / 2\):) Tj
T*
(   omega_1,2 = - R/\(2*L\) +- sqrt\( [R/\(2*L\)]^2 + 1/\(LC\) \).) Tj
T*
(   - Bandwidth: Delta-omega = omega_2 - omega_1 = R / L => Delta-f = f_2 - f_1 = R / \(2 * pi * L\)) Tj
T*
(   = f_0 / Q.) Tj
