(   [Detailed Step-by-Step Answer]:) Tj
T*
(   Balanced Delta \(Mesh\) Connected 3-Phase System:) Tj
T*
(   1. Configuration and Definitions:) Tj
T*
(   - Three phase windings connected end-to-end forming a closed loop \(Delta: R-Y-B\).) Tj
T*
(   - Terminals are tapped at the three connection vertices.) Tj
T*
(   2. Line and Phase Voltages:) Tj
T*
(   - The line terminals are connected directly across the terminals of each individual phase) Tj
T*
(   winding:) Tj
T*
