T*
(   I_YB = I_ph /_ -120 deg.) Tj
T*
(   I_BR = I_ph /_ +120 deg.) Tj
T*
(   - Line current entering line R by KCL at node R:) Tj
T*
(   I_R = I_RY - I_BR = I_ph /_ 0 deg - I_ph /_ +120 deg.) Tj
T*
(   - Converting to rectangular coordinates:) Tj
T*
(   I_R = I_ph * [ \(1 + j0\) - \(-1/2 + j*sqrt\(3\)/2\) ] = I_ph * [ 3/2 - j*sqrt\(3\)/2 ].) Tj
T*
(   - Magnitude:) Tj
T*
(   |I_R| = I_ph * sqrt\( \(3/2\)^2 + \(-sqrt\(3\)/2\)^2 \) = I_ph * sqrt\( 9/4 + 3/4 \) = sqrt\(3\) * I_ph.) Tj
T*
(   - Phase Angle:) Tj
T*
(   theta = arctan\( [-sqrt\(3\)/2] / [3/2] \) = -30 degrees.) Tj
T*
(   - General Law: In delta connection, Line Current is sqrt\(3\) times Phase Current and lags the) Tj
T*
(   corresponding phase current by 30 degrees:) Tj
T*
(   I_L = sqrt\(3\) * I_ph.) Tj
T*
(   4. Total Active Power:) Tj
T*
(   - P = 3 * V_ph * I_ph * cos\(phi\) = 3 * V_L * \(I_L / sqrt\(3\)\) * cos\(phi\) = sqrt\(3\) * V_L * I_L *) Tj
T*
(   cos\(phi\).) Tj
