(   [Problem Statement]: Derive the mathematical formula for power factor correction, determining the required rating of a shunt capacitor bank.) Tj
T*
(   [Detailed Step-by-Step Answer]:) Tj
T*
(   Power Factor Correction Analysis:) Tj
T*
(   1. Operational Objective:) Tj
T*
(   - Industrial loads \(induction motors, welders\) draw lagging current at low power factor \(cos) Tj
T*
(   phi1\), resulting in excessive line currents, elevated I^2*R transmission losses, and poor) Tj
T*
(   voltage regulation.) Tj
T*
(   - Shunt capacitor banks supply leading reactive power \(Q_C\) locally, reducing the net reactive) Tj
T*
(   power demand from the grid from Q1 to Q2 while keeping active real power P constant.) Tj
T*
(   2. Derivation of Capacitor kVAR Rating:) Tj
T*
