(   [Problem Statement]: Explain Transient Analysis of an LC Tank circuit, deriving the equation for undamped harmonic oscillations.) Tj
T*
(   [Detailed Step-by-Step Answer]:) Tj
T*
(   Transient Dynamics of Lossless L-C Tank Circuit:) Tj
T*
(   1. Circuit Model:) Tj
T*
(   - A capacitor charged to initial voltage V0 is switched across an ideal zero-resistance) Tj
T*
(   inductor L at t = 0.) Tj
T*
(   - Initial conditions: vc\(0\) = V0, i\(0\) = 0.) Tj
T*
(   2. Differential Equation:) Tj
T*
(   - By KVL: vc\(t\) + v_L\(t\) = 0.) Tj
T*
(   - Since i\(t\) = - C * dvc/dt and v_L\(t\) = L * di/dt = - L * C * d^2 vc/dt^2:) Tj
T*
(   L * C * d^2 vc/dt^2 + vc\(t\) = 0 => d^2 vc/dt^2 + omega_0^2 * vc\(t\) = 0,) Tj
T*
